        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.491,
            0.727,
            0.843,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": "rose (563) The graph of a polar equation of the form $r = a\\cos n\\theta$ or $r = a\\sin n\\theta$."
